  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:333px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/MMM.png\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise Mezzanine\"><img alt=\"The Mutanous Malaise Mezzanine\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"438\" src=\"/images/recovered/MMM.png\" width=\"331\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/MMM.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>The Mutanous Malaise Mezzanine</b></div></div></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</td><td><b>This is the outpost to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>. There is also a portal leading back to level 5 of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<p>There are two quest NPCs stationed here: \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gee_Dubya_Shrub\" title=\"Gee Dubya Shrub\">Gee Dubya Shrub</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tipper_Gourd\" title=\"Tipper Gourd\">Tipper Gourd</a>.\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
